comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T22:29:48.459Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live full all-status export contained 2751 items with no omitted rows. Request-specific CLI searches and full historical metadata distinguished the existing shipped predecessor from this new report. Reuse its typed lineage; leave this intake open and unclaimed because implementation is not active."
  "2026-09-13T09:09:32.115Z","harness:codex","Implementation context: complete live all-status export contained 2755 items, no unreadable rows or omissions. Existing predecessor pm-v1yo deliberately rejected core-prefix grafts; this item refines that policy for unique leaves under existing groups while preserving core leaf ownership. GitHub has no open PRs or security alerts; all nine open issues already have canonical tracker links. Connected tranche also includes pm-zsic8h and pm-4f86c4."
  "2026-09-13T09:21:02.137Z","harness:codex","TDD and acceptance evidence: the initial regression run failed the expected new assertions before implementation. Connected focused suite now passes 144 tests. A temporary initialized workspace installed the published pm-ops package and executed ops metrics beside core ops health; three-item default list is six lines and start guidance retains claim --start. Full coverage and hosted validation remain pending. Live Sentry 14-day threshold read is accessible with zero blocking issues; required telemetry gate passes with 2.21 percent finish error rate and no missing error-code rows. This aggregate gate is not per-action correlation proof."
  "2026-09-13T09:27:45.200Z","harness:codex","Initial full suite: 8807 passing tests and one obsolete blanket namespace refusal assertion. Updated that existing contract to allow unique sibling leaves while explicitly retaining the reserved-facet handler collision assertion. No coverage result was produced by the failed suite; complete coverage remains pending."
  "2026-09-13T09:45:59.321Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 683 test files and 8808 tests passed. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100: statements 64355/64355, branches 49089/49089, functions 13372/13372, lines 61640/61640. No thresholds or exclusions were weakened. Static code, documentation, duplicate, contract, SDK surface, and performance checks passed; the initial graph prose-reference failure was corrected with typed relationships, then graph and record-integrity assurance passed. Packed consumer and hosted review evidence remain pending."
  "2026-09-13T09:49:46.608Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance passed: context evaluation and 57 token surfaces; npx/bunx packed package smoke; separate npm and Bun tarball consumers exercising SDK canonicalization, initialization, mutations, six-line TOON, and full JSON; package-first authoring dogfood; compatibility migration with health and validation true. Reviewed delivery closure captures implementation and local verification; GitHub checks, bot review, merge, and publication are separate pending claims."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-13T09:23:15.633Z","harness:codex","Namespace ownership must account for lazy registration: the early ops group has no children yet. Reserve declared core leaves before package registration, allow unique sibling leaves, and preserve intentional metadata augmentation on an already registered core node. The manual published pm-ops reproduction exposed this boundary after the first unit test passed."
